# Initial publication uses an explicit allowlist.
# Add reviewed source directories deliberately when preparing a code release.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# Private configuration and local build output stay excluded at every depth.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credentials*
**/*secrets*
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/SaveData/
**/SaveDataBackup/
**/Library/
**/Temp/
**/Logs/
**/UserSettings/
**/*.log
**/*.log.gz

